1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,500
₦50,000. Na grant, no be loan.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,500
Dem call am NERSI: support for poor and vulnerable families.

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:11,500
Dem dey pick people from the National Social Register.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,000
So how you go take apply?

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,500
You no fit apply…

6
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,500
…and nobody fit sell you space for the list.

7
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:22,000
If dem pick you, your provider go send you SMS.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,500
Accept am, and ₦50,000 go land for your wallet.

9
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:32,500
To check, dial any provider code, then choose ‘Check eligibility’.

10
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,500
E dey free. No pay anybody…

11
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:38,000
…and no ever share your PIN or OTP.

12
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:45,000
You no sure? Call the help line before you do anything.

